Prime (Zero) is the central station on [[the Horizon]], the tram line that runs the length of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. The stop takes its name from [[Prime Meridian]], which built and operates the line. Around it sits the wealthiest residential pocket in the city, a part of Hallia the tram itself does not reach; those who live there are assumed to have no need of public transport.
